    <!-- Metadata: Gowri Descriptions -->
    <string name="desc_gowri_amridha">Extremely auspicious. Best for starting any work, travels, and new ventures.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_uthi">Progressive and favorable. Good for growth, expansion, and administrative work.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_labam">Profitable. Ideal for business deals, financial transactions, and trade.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_dhanam">Wealth creating. Favorable for investments and purchasing assets.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_sugam">Comfortable. Good for peace-related activities and domestic matters.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_soram">Theft/Loss risk. Avoid handling large cash or starting high-risk work.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_visham">Poisonous/Toxic. Avoid medical treatments or starting new projects.</string>
    <string name="desc_gowri_rogam">Disease/Sickness. Inauspicious; avoid health-related activities or travel.</string>

    <!-- Metadata: Special Descriptions -->
    <string name="desc_timing_rahu">Inauspicious period. Avoid starting new ventures, major purchases, or important meetings.\n\nDo: Routine tasks, cleaning, spiritual practices.\nDon\'t: Travel, signing contracts, buying assets.</string>
    <string name="desc_timing_yama">Inauspicious period. Often associated with loss or obstacles. Avoid beginning anything new.\n\nDo: Repaying debts, finishing pending work, letting go.\nDon\'t: New projects, medical treatments, long journeys.</string>
    <string name="desc_timing_kuli">Expansion period. What is done during this time tends to repeat. Good for buying assets, not for bad deeds.\n\nDo: Charity, investments, starting positive habits.\nDon\'t: Incurring debt, funeral rituals, negative behaviors.</string>
    <string name="desc_timing_nalla">Most auspicious time of the day for important activities.</string>

    <!-- Metadata: Planet Qualities -->
    <string name="quality_sun">Authority, Vitality, Leadership. Focus on administration and meetings with superiors.</string>
    <string name="quality_moon">Emotion, Nurture, Change. Good for creative work and home-related matters.</string>
    <string name="quality_mars">Energy, Action, Courage. Focus on physical tasks, but watch for conflicts.</string>
    <string name="quality_mercury">Intellect, Communication, Trade. Ideal for study, writing, and business.</string>
    <string name="quality_jupiter">Wisdom, Expansion, Luck. Best for learning, teaching, and rituals.</string>
    <string name="quality_venus">Beauty, Harmony, Luxury. Good for arts, romance, and socializing.</string>
    <string name="quality_saturn">Discipline, Delay, Hard work. Focus on routine tasks and clearing backlogs.</string>

    <!-- Hora Guidance -->
    <string name="guidance_sun_fav">Highly auspicious for leadership and power. Best for meetings with authorities, starting new roles, and seeking government favors.</string>
    <string name="guidance_sun_conf">Conflicting solar energy. Ego clashes possible. Avoid stubbornness or confrontations with superiors. Stick to individual tasks.</string>
    <string name="guidance_sun_neut">Steady vitality. Good for administration and planning. Focus on your health and maintaining a disciplined schedule.</string>

    <string name="guidance_moon_fav">Emotionally harmonious. Ideal for domestic work, creative arts, and connecting with family. Mind is calm and focused.</string>
    <string name="guidance_moon_conf">Fluctuating moods. Avoid making major decisions based on emotion. Not a good time for deep emotional conversations.</string>
    <string name="guidance_moon_neut">Gentle energy. Suitable for regular chores, cooking, and minor changes. Good for small social interactions.</string>

    <string name="guidance_mars_fav">High energy and courage. Best for physical labor, sports, and competitive tasks. Bold actions bring success.</string>
    <string name="guidance_mars_conf">High friction. Risk of accidents or arguments. Avoid rushing, sharp tools, or aggressive negotiations. Be patient.</string>
    <string name="guidance_mars_neut">Active energy. Focus on technical work or home repairs. Keep physical activity moderate to avoid burnout.</string>

    <string name="guidance_mercury_fav">Intellectually sharp. Excellent for business deals, writing, learning new skills, and all forms of communication.</string>
    <string name="guidance_mercury_conf">Information overload. Communication errors likely. Double-check all emails and documents. Avoid starting new studies now.</string>
    <string name="guidance_mercury_neut">Mental clarity. Good for organization, record-keeping, and catching up on correspondence. A practical time for logic.</string>

    <string name="guidance_jupiter_fav">Highly auspicious. Best for starting new education, major financial investments, or spiritual ceremonies. Expansion is favored.</string>
    <string name="guidance_jupiter_conf">Conflicting energies. Venus (pleasure) and Jupiter (wisdom) may clash. Avoid over-indulgence or making impulsive luxury purchases.</string>
    <string name="guidance_jupiter_neut">A good time for learning and general growth. Focus on steady progress rather than big leaps.</string>

    <string name="guidance_venus_fav">Harmonious and creative. Perfect for arts, social gatherings, buying jewelry/clothes, and romantic activities.</string>
    <string name="guidance_venus_conf">Emotional extravagance. Risk of overspending on luxuries. Aesthetic choices made now might be regretted later.</string>
    <string name="guidance_venus_neut">Pleasant atmosphere. Good for minor beautification and relaxing. Focus on building relationships gently.</string>

    <string name="guidance_saturn_fav">Solid foundation. Best for long-term planning, clearing debts, and tasks requiring intense discipline and endurance.</string>
    <string name="guidance_saturn_conf">Heavy delays. Frustration likely with slow progress. Avoid starting anything that needs quick results. Rest is advised.</string>
    <string name="guidance_saturn_neut">Pragmatic energy. Focus on routine work, cleaning, and organized labor. Persistence will pay off later.</string>

    <string name="guidance_default">A time for balanced action and mindfulness.</string>

